{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31402","headline":"和襄阳徐相公商贺徐副使加章绶 · 王传","name":"和襄阳徐相公商贺徐副使加章绶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱紫联辉照日新，芳菲全属断金人。\n华筵重处宗盟地，白雪飞时郢曲春。\n仙府色饶攀桂侣，莲花光让握兰身。\n自怜亦是膺门客，吟想恩荣气益振。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王传","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31402.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31402","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}